  "name": "Shining Smite",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The target hit by the strike takes an extra 2d6 Radiant damage from the attack. Until the spell ends, the target sheds &amp;Reference[BrightLight] in a 5-foot radius, attack rolls against it have Advantage, and it can’t benefit from the &amp;Reference[Invisible] condition.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.</p>",
